Package: com.opa334.cranereconstruction
Name: Crane (reconstruction)
Version: 6.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Depends: mobilesubstrate, ellekit, libhooker, firmware, altlist, activator, choicy
Maintainer: reconstruction <nobody@example.invalid>
Author: Lars Fröder (opa334) <opa334@opa334.dev>
Section: Tweaks
Description: Behavioural reconstruction of Crane, an iOS container-switching
 jailbreak tweak. Install paths, Substrate filters, libSandy profiles,
 preference keys and the launch-environment contract are reproduced from the
 recovered package. See analysis/ for the evidence ledger and
 final/KNOWN_DIFFERENCES.md for what is NOT reproduced.
